\f3 \cf0 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f4\fs26 \'93What has happened to them?\'94 The High Elvis asked of the Minister for Internal Security. \'93That display has sent a shock wave though our fledgling nation.\'94\
\'93They are suffering from an extreme case of Evangelism and we are all susceptible if exposure is protracted. According to what they have told us, they were researching old texts, ancient songs and music of the black discs when they stumbled across some hymns. It started out innocently enough, but they ended up with a dependency. The harmonies of Gospel are just too powerful for an Elvis to resist, they are all completely infected with Christianity and unresponsive to evidence based thought or rational argument.\'94 The Minister for Internal Security, was completely exhausted from hours of reasoned debate being met with the deliberately obtuse. \'93It started with a small choir, but by the end they were conducting white masses, baptising each other and then got into sexual abstinence.\'94\
\'93Celibacy? That\'92s just plain sick. Is there much hope for them?\'94 The High Elvis hoped they would just snap out of it, but this sounded far too serious for a miracle cure. He had only been in the chair for five minutes when this dangerous meme popped up to spoil the show. If it spread his people could turn away from the true path and embrace blind faith. Something unthinkable.\
\'93Personally, I am not hopeful, but none of us have any experience in these matters. Until today we were both low-rent entertainers.\'94 The Minister for Internal Security was still getting used to his lofty new position. \'93We have the welfare of the entire Elvi to protect and need some expert advice.\'94\
\'93It is good to see that you are also humbled by the burden of leadership. We must seek the counsel of the Wise Three. Send a delegation to the Travelator to locate Kleo, Silo and Chilo and invite them to walk among our number, spreading The Dawkins\'92 grace. They will know how to treat our diseased brothers.\'94 The High Elvis did not know if they could help, he wanted to project strength and confidence. \'93We will have to do something about this gospel music. Find out if it is an isolated case or if there is a larger infection, Mr Minister for Health..\'94\
\'93What? Yes, of course, High Elvis.\'94 The new minister was still getting used to the title. \'93To ensure no further outbreaks, I would suggest a complete ban on Gospel music or, for that matter, any music with a religious context.\'94\
\'93I really don\'92t wish to resort to censorship, there are always too many grey areas, but it may be the only way. What is the alternative? If there is an outbreak of this meme it could infect us all. We have to keep a lid on this and squash it down hard.\'94 His fondest hope was for his beloved Elvi to practice their art in any way they deemed fit. Blocking an avenue of expression, as one of the first acts of his administration, did not augur well.
